      <definition>adv. In vain, uselessly, to no purpose.</definition>
      <page>771</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠯᠠᠭᠠᠷ ᠪᠣᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
