          <definition> To become useless.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠳᠦᠷ ᠰᠠᠷ᠎ᠠ ᠎ᠶᠢ ᠲᠠᠯᠠᠭᠠᠷ ᠥᠩᠭᠡᠷᠡᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
